<!doctype html><html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Worker"><link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/apple-touch-icon.png"><title>Worker — реальные сообщения</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;font:15px system-ui}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#edf2f9;color:#17243a}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff}button.secondary{background:#e4eaf5;color:#263b59}input{padding:13px;border:1px solid #c9d3e3;border-radius:12px;width:100%;background:white;color:#17243a}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;min-height:100dvh;background:white;box-shadow:0 0 30px #18345c15}.bar{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4eaf5}.logo{display:grid;place-items:center;width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:50%;background:#2563eb;color:white;font-size:25px;font-weight:900}.grow{flex:1}.auth{max-width:430px;margin:8vh auto;padding:25px;display:grid;gap:12px}.auth h1{margin:0}.hint{color:#64748b;font-size:13px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:290px 1fr;height:calc(100dvh - 72px)}.side{border-right:1px solid #e4eaf5;padding:12px;overflow:auto}.side button{width:100%;text-align:left;margin:4px 0}.chat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}.messages{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.bubble{max-width:80%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:16px;background:#eef2f7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.mine{align-self:flex-end;background:#dbeafe}.compose{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px;border-top:1px solid #e4eaf5}.compose input{flex:1}.hide{display:none!important}.status{padding:10px;color:#b42318;min-height:32px}.account{font-size:12px;color:#64748b}.switches{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}.switches button{font-size:12px;padding:7px}.name{font-weight:700} @media(max-width:650px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{max-height:28dvh;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e4eaf5}.messages{min-height:35dvh}.chat{min-height:60dvh}.bar{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style></head><body><main><header class="bar"><div class="logo">W</div><div class="grow"><b>Worker</b><div class="hint">Реальные личные сообщения</div></div><a href="index.html">Демо</a></header><section id="setup" class="auth hide"><h1>Подключение</h1><p>Для реальных аккаунтов нужно настроить Supabase. Открой README.md из архива и заполни config.js.</p></section><section id="auth" class="auth hide"><h1>Вход / регистрация</h1><input id="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email"><input id="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Пароль (минимум 8 символов)"><input id="username" placeholder="Юзернейм при регистрации (5–32 символа)"><input id="displayName" placeholder="Имя при регистрации"><button id="signIn">Войти</button><button class="secondary" id="signUp">Зарегистрироваться</button><p class="hint">При включённом подтверждении email сначала перейди по ссылке в письме. На одном устройстве можно сохранить до 3 аккаунтов.</p><div id="authError" class="status" role="alert"></div></section><section id="app" class="hide"><div class="bar"><div class="grow"><div class="name" id="me"></div><div class="account" id="accountCount"></div></div><button class="secondary" id="addAccount">+ Аккаунт</button><button class="secondary" id="logout">Выйти</button></div><div class="switches" id="switches" style="padding:8px"></div><div class="layout"><aside class="side"><label class="hint">Найти пользователя по точному юзернейму</label><input id="search" placeholder="username"><button id="find">Найти</button><div id="people"></div></aside><section class="chat"><div class="bar"><div class="grow" id="peerName">Выбери собеседника</div><button class="secondary hide" id="block">Заблокировать</button></div><div class="messages" id="messages"></div><form class="compose" id="compose"><input id="message" placeholder="Сообщение" maxlength="4000" autocomplete="off"><button>➤</button></form><div class="status" id="error" role="alert"></div></section></div></section></main><script src="config.js"></script><script type="module" src="live.js"></script></body></html>
